Announcement that for calendar year 2025, starting Monday, January 6, 2025, the Public Services Committee will meet on the first and third Mondays of the month at 12:00 p.m. (Noon) and the Finance Committee will meet on the first and third Tuesdays of the month at 12:00 p.m. (Noon) in Room 104 of the Municipal Building at 2101 O’Neil Avenue.
